You are doing a major refactoring of a Node.js/Express server. The source file is `/Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Boldteq App/Operation/Polyglot/src/server.js` (5,282 lines, CommonJS).

Your job: Create 20 route modules in `src/routes/` and a slim `src/server.js`. 

## Context already done:
- `src/lib/atomicIo.js` ✅ — atomicWriteJson, atomicWriteText, readFileSafe, ensureDir, setCacheInvalidator
- `src/lib/cache.js` ✅ — parseAgent, parseAgentMeta, listAgents, listAgentsMeta, _invalidateAgentCache
- `src/lib/validators.js` ✅ — validateName, validateProjectId, resolveProjectPath
- `src/lib/discovery.js` ✅ — discoverProjects, listMdFiles
- `src/lib/graph.js` ✅ — topoSort, topoLevels
- `src/lib/diff.js` ✅ — computeLineDiff
- `src/middleware/cors.js` ✅
- `src/middleware/localOnly.js` ✅
- `src/middleware/rateLimit.js` ✅ — exports rateLimit factory
- `src/middleware/security.js` ✅

## Your task: Read server.js thoroughly and create these route files:

### Route modules to create in `src/routes/`:

1. **config.js** — Routes: GET/POST `/api/config`, `/api/config/project-dirs`, GET/PUT `/api/global/claude-md`, GET/PUT `/api/global/settings`
2. **agents.js** — Routes: GET/PUT/DELETE `/api/global/agents`, `/api/global/agents/:name`, GET/PUT/DELETE `/api/projects/:id/agents/:name`, GET `/api/agents/:name/health`, POST `/api/copy-agent`, POST `/api/move-agent`
3. **rules.js** — Routes: GET/PUT/DELETE `/api/global/rules/:name`, `/api/projects/:id/rules/:name`, GET `/api/rule-templates`, POST `/api/init-rules`
4. **commands.js** — Routes: GET/PUT/DELETE `/api/projects/:id/commands/:name`
5. **projects.js** — Routes: GET `/api/projects`, POST `/api/browse`, GET `/api/projects/:id` (detail endpoint)
6. **categories.js** — Routes: GET/POST/PUT/DELETE `/api/categories`, `/api/categories/reorder`, `/api/categories/rename`
7. **ai.js** — Routes: GET/POST/DELETE `/api/ai/history`, GET `/api/ai/context`, POST `/api/ai/apply`, GET `/api/ai/docs-cache`, POST `/api/ai/chat` (SSE streaming)
8. **orchestrations.js** — Routes: GET/POST/DELETE `/api/orchestrations`, `/api/orchestrations/run`, `/api/orchestrations/run-history`, `/api/orchestrations/approvals`, `/api/orchestrations/export`
9. **playground.js** — Routes: POST `/api/playground/run`, GET/DELETE `/api/playground/history`
10. **memory.js** — Routes: GET/POST/PUT/DELETE `/api/memory/*`, `/api/memory/audit`, `/api/memory/history`
11. **backup.js** — Routes: GET/POST `/api/backup/*` (delegates to `src/backup.js`)
12. **templates.js** — Routes: GET/PUT/DELETE `/api/templates`, `/api/templates/:name`
13. **training.js** — Routes: GET/POST/PUT/DELETE `/api/training/:name`, POST `/api/training/:name/bake`
14. **analytics.js** — Routes: GET `/api/analytics/runs`, GET `/api/analytics/summary`
15. **goals.js** — Routes: GET/POST/PUT `/api/goals`
16. **schedules.js** — Routes: GET/POST/PUT/DELETE `/api/schedules`, `/api/schedules/:id`; also exports `bootSchedules(app)` function
17. **webhooks.js** — Routes: GET/POST/DELETE `/api/webhooks`, POST `/api/webhooks/trigger/:id`
18. **learning.js** — Routes: POST `/api/learning/route`, POST `/api/learning/record`, DELETE `/api/learning/agent/:name`, GET/POST/PUT `/api/routing`, GET `/api/routing/savings`, GET/POST/PUT/DELETE `/api/claims`
19. **orgHr.js** — Routes: GET `/api/org-chart`, GET `/api/departments`, GET `/api/org/drift`, PATCH `/api/org/agent/:id`, all `/api/hr/*` routes
20. **dbExplorer.js** — Routes: GET `/api/db/tables`, GET `/api/db/table/:name`, POST `/api/db/query`, GET `/api/db/stats`, GET `/api/db/export`, PUT/DELETE `/api/db/table/:name/:pk`, GET/POST `/api/db/changes`, POST `/api/db/changes/:id/revert`
21. **health.js** — Routes: GET `/api/health`, GET `/api/docs`, GET `/api/setup/*`

## Important patterns for each route file:
```js
'use strict';
const { Router } = require('express');
const db = require('../db');
const { rateLimit } = require('../middleware/rateLimit');
const { validateName, validateProjectId } = require('../lib/validators');
// ... other imports as needed

